  "notes": [
    "vs.CreateVP makes a viewport that hides class None, and its box is a 13.34 mm placeholder square at the sheet origin. vs.SetVPClassVisibility(vp, 'None', 0) and then vs.ResetObject(vp) make it frame the model. Object variable 1003 is the scale, here 1:50.",
    "Each viewport shows one design layer. visibilityType 0 is visible and -1 is invisible. The document is saved with Rosetta-Sheet-2 active."
